    "dialogue:ep95-map-intro-1:en": {
      "text": "The Tang Monk and Wujing were tied up inside the demons' cave.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/50fed3481983.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep95-map-intro-1:zh": {
      "text": "唐僧与武二郎被捆绑在恶魔洞穴内。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/16a51ba62efb.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep95-map-intro-2:en": {
      "text": "Bajie was also tied up, floating in the tub of salt water again.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/b616ee3ff98a.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep95-map-intro-2:zh": {
      "text": "八戒也被捆绑着,再次漂浮在盐水中。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/c444b3770444.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep95-map-quiz-1:en": {
      "text": "\"They ate the Tang Monk, and now they'll live forever,\" said the first fiend.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/5afc397c26be.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n030"
    },
    "dialogue:ep95-map-quiz-1:zh": {
      "text": "\"他们吃掉了唐僧,如今便可永生,\"第一个魔头说道。",
